{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Camera｜流程图\n一次视角拉取的主路径。类与接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_相机.canvas|结构图]]、[[Camera/结构|结构文档]]；细节见 [[GGYGO_流程_相机覆盖恢复.canvas|覆盖恢复]]、[[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|模式求值]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1720,
      "height": 145,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "engine",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. UE 通过 ViewTarget 调用 CameraComponent::GetCameraView。\n\n调用：UE PlayerCameraManager/ViewTarget → CameraComponent::GetCameraView(dt, OutMinimalViewInfo)。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. HeroComponent 从 Ability 覆盖列表或 PawnData 选有效模式。\n\n调用：CameraComponent::UpdateCameraModes → DetermineCameraModeDelegate → HeroComponent::DetermineCameraMode；返回 Mode Class。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "push",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. CameraComponent 把模式类交给 CameraModeStack。\n\n调用：CameraModeStack::PushCameraMode(ModeClass)；按类复用模式实例并移至索引 0。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. Stack 更新并混合各 CameraMode 的 View。\n[[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|展开]]\n\n调用：CameraModeStack::EvaluateStack(dt, OutView) → Mode::UpdateCameraMode / View::Blend。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "offset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. CameraComponent 对最终 View 叠加 CameraOffset。\n\n调用：CameraComponent 在 EvaluateStack 后应用 FGGYGOCameraOffset；不改各 Mode 的原始 View。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 905,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. 写入最终 FOV/位置/Rotation 与 Controller 的 ControlRotation。\n\nGetCameraView 将 View.ControlRotation 写 Controller，View.Location/Rotation/FOV 写 FMinimalViewInfo。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 945,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "兜底：模式类为空或栈为空时，用 UCameraComponent 自身视角。\n\n若委托返回空类或 Stack 无有效 View，调用 Super::GetCameraView(dt, OutView)。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 999,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "engine",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "choose",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "GetCameraView → UpdateCameraModes"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "choose",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "push",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "DetermineCameraModeDelegate → Mode Class"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "push",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "evaluate",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "PushCameraMode → EvaluateStack"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "evaluate",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "offset",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "EvaluateStack → FGGYGOCameraModeView"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "offset",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "output",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Offset → FMinimalViewInfo"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "choose",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "empty",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Mode Class 为空"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "fromNode": "empty",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "output",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Super::GetCameraView 兜底"
    }
  ]
}
